WEBVTT

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:15.340
that can shake the vast universe.

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:19.240
There are many who have heard that terrible scream.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:22.670
But who is that?

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.220
Is it a human? A beast?

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:28.580
Or is it a giant, dark monster?

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.640
in the Hidu.

00:02:00.280 --> 00:02:06.500
The red, green, blue, yellow, and green lions that first appeared...

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:09.980
were crushed by a giant Death Black beast.

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:15.620
The news was immediately sent to the Great Bazaar from Sadak.

00:02:15.620 --> 00:02:29.120
The titans are back!

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:51.000
15 years ago, the Artea planet was completely destroyed by me.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:55.000
But what does it mean that the Space Lions attacked us?

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:58.800
What's wrong, Yaga?

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:04.520
Honerba, what did Yaga say?

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:09.120
Great Emperor Bazaar, don't be discouraged.

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:10.150
What?

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:13.740
Yaga said he felt an ominous curse.

00:03:13.800 --> 00:03:19.170
A huge black shadow was blocking the way to the Empire of Garuda.

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:22.820
A huge black shadow? What is that?

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:30.000
Great Emperor, I don't know anything more than that.

00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:37.660
Honerba, tell Sadaq that we will search the Artea Star thoroughly!

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:43.520
I will go with all the troops of the Great Empire of Galra!

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:48.950
Begin the operation at dawn and search the entire area of the Artea Star!

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:54.390
Those who give up their lives to the Great Empire of Galra will be killed!

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:11.460
Follow me.

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:42.900
Okay.

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:04.360
We've arrived at the hotel!

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:32.290
After regaining consciousness,

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:35.080
Suzuishi received a sad report from Princess Faala.

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:39.830
It was reported that her four lions' friends were missing.

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:47.000
How could you leave such an idiot alone?

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:52.760
There's no such thing as an idiot.

00:06:26.720 --> 00:06:30.000
The four of them were forced to leave the city.

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:31.380
I've summoned you to death.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.920
Do you think you can get away with this so easily?

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:07.650
Chibi, we're safe here too.

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:09.740
What a mess!

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:12.140
I slept well.

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:14.140
What are you talking about, Koki?

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:17.880
It's the weather!

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:19.730
Oh, Chibi. I'm sorry to worry about you.

00:07:19.730 --> 00:07:21.780
Yahoo!

00:07:24.970 --> 00:07:26.970
I was so worried that my head was going to go crazy.

00:07:27.690 --> 00:07:30.000
I don't want to do this anymore.

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:33.960
I'm sorry.

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:39.670
Chibi, we're going back now.

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:09.840
Fara-hime, where is Chibi?

00:08:09.840 --> 00:08:13.860
She's nowhere to be found.

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:16.700
Chibi, I'm home!

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:18.930
Hime, you're hiding something, aren't you?

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:21.700
What?

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:30.000
Don't bother me like that.

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:31.720
This guy!

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:32.660
Oh, my!

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:34.130
Ow, ow, ow!

00:08:37.130 --> 00:08:41.100
By the way, have you found the other five keys?

00:08:41.100 --> 00:08:42.000
No.

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:46.890
The Great Battleship of the Galra Empire will attack in the middle of the night.

00:08:46.890 --> 00:08:50.470
Besides, they hate big, stupid titans.

00:08:50.470 --> 00:08:53.110
Yeah, if we keep this up, there won't be a single one left.

00:08:53.110 --> 00:08:56.940
No matter what, I want the key to the Goryon's main body.

00:08:56.940 --> 00:08:58.070
That's right!

00:08:58.070 --> 00:08:59.920
The legendary robot of the universe.

00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:02.470
In order to combine the Goryeons,

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:05.700
we need the key to the main room.

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:09.120
Why don't we check the royal tomb once more?

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:17.320
-It's not here. -It's not here.

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:19.430
Hey, look at this.

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:20.640
This hole.

00:09:20.640 --> 00:09:22.820
Who opened this hole?

00:09:22.820 --> 00:09:26.800
This is after we bit it.

00:09:26.800 --> 00:09:28.840
What if we bite the stone?

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:33.960
It's an alien rat!

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:35.150
What? A rat?

00:09:35.150 --> 00:09:39.050
There's a whole family of rats in this castle.

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:43.440
There are no other animals, so we have no choice but to kill that rat.

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:44.640
A rat, huh?

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:47.660
But where is that rat in this wide castle?

00:09:47.660 --> 00:09:49.000
No need to worry about that.

00:09:49.000 --> 00:09:51.460
I know how many rats there are.

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:52.490
What did you say?

00:09:52.490 --> 00:09:59.440
If you can tell, everyone, let's go!

00:10:01.980 --> 00:10:02.850
Thank you.

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:36.330
Here, take this.

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:38.810
Don't you know what this key is like?

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:45.840
But it's got some really big teeth!

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:47.070
Come on, come on!

00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:49.780
Hurry up and take us to Kagi-no-Arika!

00:10:49.780 --> 00:10:53.640
If there's any left, I'll turn you into a grilled mouse and eat you up!

00:10:53.640 --> 00:10:54.690
Whoa!

00:10:54.690 --> 00:10:55.860
Stop it!

00:10:57.930 --> 00:10:59.800
Princess Farah!

00:11:00.160 --> 00:11:04.810
Pratt and Chuchul are my friends.

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:11.310
I was always alone when I was a child.

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:17.090
Thinking of my father, mother, and siblings,

00:11:17.090 --> 00:11:19.660
I was lonely and cried all the time.

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:24.200
Pratt and Chuchul comforted me at that time.

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:09.770
Please, I don't know what you did, but please save Platt and Chuchuro.

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:11.770
I don't mind, but...

00:12:11.770 --> 00:12:15.150
He stole the keys to the Goraion.

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:19.910
Platt...

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:24.090
I wonder if he understands the words of a mouse.

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:25.650
You scared me.

00:12:25.650 --> 00:12:29.890
Platt said that he protected them because they were so beautiful.

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:31.450
So it's an amulet, huh?

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:32.650
I don't like that.

00:12:32.650 --> 00:12:37.300
Bala, tell the rat that I'll bring the key right away.

00:12:37.300 --> 00:12:37.840
Yes.

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:03.840
Thank you, Blood!

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:14.850
Oh, this is truly the key to Goraion's main!

00:13:14.850 --> 00:13:15.840
Hyrule!

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:18.170
We did it, Nezuko!

00:13:18.170 --> 00:13:20.130
We did it!

00:13:20.130 --> 00:13:21.020
We did it!

00:13:21.020 --> 00:13:25.590
I've been informed.

00:13:25.590 --> 00:13:28.160
Please be happy, Oryou.

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:38.200
The time has finally come for the legendary robots of space, the Goryons, to set out.

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:44.990
Five heroes will ride the Goryons and fight the space warship of the Great Empire of Nikkuki-Garura.

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:46.770
I'm counting on you.

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:49.920
Yes, sir.

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:56.320
Follow the entire army of the Great Empire.

00:13:56.320 --> 00:13:59.890
Kill all the Artea citizens! Kill them all!

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:00.580
Kill him!

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:32.150
I won't let you get away with this!

00:14:32.150 --> 00:14:43.240
What do you mean?

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:46.770
To kill innocent people like that...

00:14:46.770 --> 00:14:48.280
Daivazar is a demon!

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:50.840
I hate the Grand Empire of Gunga!

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:53.330
Oh dear, you don't have time to complain.

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:54.510
Kifu.

00:14:54.510 --> 00:14:59.410
Soldier, please send Goraion to attack!

00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:03.360
We can't combine with the Goryeons without training.

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:06.020
Gunshin! Gunshin!

00:15:06.020 --> 00:15:10.410
If we fail to combine, you may not be alive.

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:14.050
We thought we were going to die anyway,

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:15.570
so we escaped from the Gargoyles.

00:15:15.570 --> 00:15:18.720
Please go out!

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:23.220
Let the Goryeons go out.

00:15:23.220 --> 00:15:26.020
Yes, sir!

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:30.000
We'll pray for your safety.

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:33.300
Lion's fish!

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:20.580
That's it!

00:16:49.100 --> 00:16:53.060
They're alive!

00:16:53.060 --> 00:17:00.000
Death Black Beast, I'll beat them to death!

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:10.400
Stop it!

00:17:10.400 --> 00:17:11.430
He's out.

00:17:11.430 --> 00:17:20.260
Oki, Otenkia, Chibi!

00:17:20.260 --> 00:17:22.630
Give me your lives!

00:17:22.630 --> 00:17:23.850
Yes, sir!

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:28.680
That was close.

00:17:37.930 --> 00:17:39.160
- Whoa!

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:42.240
It's the G-Lion!

00:18:42.240 --> 00:18:48.980
Come on, G-Lion!

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:09.350
I won't lose to you!

00:19:09.350 --> 00:19:12.200
Everyone, one more time!

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:23.000
Aaaaah!

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:26.320
Everyone, run!

00:19:26.320 --> 00:19:27.700
Uwaaah!

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:29.190
Nngh!

00:19:32.720 --> 00:19:35.860
Hang in there!

00:19:35.860 --> 00:19:41.110
It's closed! The temperature is going down!

00:19:42.580 --> 00:19:49.240
Let's combine!

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:31.570
*Burps*

00:22:48.680 --> 00:22:54.830
The legend of the universe, the giant robot, Goryon, has now come back to life.

00:22:54.830 --> 00:22:59.410
In order to destroy the ambitions of the Great Empire of Galra...

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:26.180
He was buried in this place.

00:24:07.960 --> 00:24:12.170
In the next episode, the news of Goraion's revival will spread all over the universe.

00:24:12.170 --> 00:24:14.500
Hope has been revived in the slave.

00:24:14.500 --> 00:24:19.330
However, Daivazar has captured the strongest of the beasts and is approaching Altea Castle.

00:24:19.330 --> 00:24:22.490
Next time, a new battle fortress.

00:24:22.490 --> 00:24:24.040
Look forward to it!
